WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now, I thought I'd share
some of my favorite

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.236 align:start size:94% position:6%
Spring Break haiku poems
from you guys.

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:06.840 align:start size:94% position:6%
This first one's from
@mic-- Micalean?

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.242 align:start size:94% position:6%
He says,
"Night has cooled the air.

00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:13.880
Fire glows red as solo cups.
Trish pukes on the beach."

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:14.948 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:17.283 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That's beautiful.

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:18.818 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Wow.

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:21.921
Wow. I think I read that on
a Celestial Seasonings box.

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:25.158 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yes.
You're right.

00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:27.427 line:92%
-This is from @theladyabba.

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:29.329 align:start size:94% position:6%
She says,
"I don't need sunscreen.

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:33.066
Curse my human arrogance.
Pass the aloe, please."

00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:33.700 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:36.236
You've got to try it once.
-You've got to -- you know.

00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:38.405 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Come on.

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:40.740 line:92%
-This one's from @NardJerry.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:43.243 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-NardJerry.

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:44.778 align:start size:94% position:6%
He says,
"Planned epic road trip.

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:49.082
Car broke down on the first day.
Spring break'd in Pittsburgh."

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:50.417 line:92%
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:00:50.417 --> 00:00:53.153 align:start size:94% position:6%
Ain't no party
like a party in Pittsburgh.

00:00:53.153 --> 00:00:56.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
The party in Pittsburgh
don't stop.

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:59.125 align:start size:94% position:6%
This one's from
@cupcakesfordoughnuts.

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:00.827 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Ooh.

00:01:00.827 --> 00:01:03.630 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Interesting conundrum.

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:05.932 align:start size:94% position:6%
She says,
"Dreamt of beaches, waves.

00:01:05.932 --> 00:01:09.469 size:88% position:44%
Wait, it rains in Miami?
Didn't know that. Crap."

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:10.470 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:11.704 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah, it rains.

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:15.075 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:17.277 align:start size:94% position:6%
This one's from
@tylerhughes.

00:01:17.277 --> 00:01:19.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
He says,
"Nine days off school. Wait.

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:23.917
Who's feeding the class gerbil?
Rest in peace, Sprinkles."

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:27.420 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.621 line:92%
-That was from the heart.

00:01:28.621 --> 00:01:32.292 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oops.
Yeah, that was...

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:33.593 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Sprinkles.

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:34.561 size:75% position:38% line:92%
That's a great name.

00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:36.830 align:start size:94% position:6%
This one's from
@tweetonceforyes.

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:41.167
He says, "Lost -- wallet,
future career in public office.

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:42.569 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Found -- good memories."

00:01:42.569 --> 00:01:44.370 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
There you go.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
He made a choice.
-Yeah.

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:48.741 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The last one's from
@rajanvlad1.

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:50.710 align:start size:94% position:6%
He says,
"The airport line is long.

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:54.214
Why are all these people here?
Oh, crap, it's Spring Break."

00:01:54.214 --> 00:01:54.881 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah, there you go.

